2-04-2026 22:13:49', '2026-04-12', NULL, NULL, '2026-04-12T00:00:00-03:00', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 58, 1, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 2001, 'Freemium', 'bumeran', 'freemium', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.bumeran.com.ar/empleos/1118228571.html', '2026-04-13T07:05:55.097378');
