6-04-12T00:00:00-03:00', NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 1, 58, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1020, 'Aviso Talento', 'bumeran', 'talento', 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.bumeran.com.ar/empleos/1118228559.html', '2026-04-13T07:05:55.097974');
